1
00:00:00,227 --> 00:00:02,158
1632! Build a marble wonder on MUD?!

2
00:00:02,265 --> 00:00:03,169
Wait—won't it sink?!

3
00:00:03,675 --> 00:00:05,239
Even my elephant sinks in this mud!

4
00:00:05,575 --> 00:00:07,755
We sink brick wells—river water turns timber stone-hard!

5
00:00:08,445 --> 00:00:11,058
Fifteen-mile spiral ramps haul gleaming white marble skyward!

6
00:00:11,405 --> 00:00:14,601
Now crown the lotus dome with solid golden spires!

7
00:00:15,245 --> 00:00:17,029
Boss! Those four towers lean OUTWARD!

8
00:00:17,625 --> 00:00:20,492
Built that way! In quakes, they fall AWAY from the dome!

9
00:00:21,045 --> 00:00:23,113
Sunset paints it gold—then moonlight makes it glow!

10
00:00:23,375 --> 00:00:25,490
Pure Mughal genius... take all my gold!

11
00:00:25,945 --> 00:00:29,150
Four centuries strong on river wood! Subscribe for the next wonder!
